  "description": "Lee Sol, a second-year student at Onjeong High School, is a boy with a warm appearance and a moderately flashy personality. On a field trip to an art museum, Lee Sol meets Song I-do, a girl in the class next to him.\n\nLove at first sight.\n\nLee Sol, who found dating the easiest, did as usual.\n\nHe confesses it to Song I-do, but Song I-do hears Lee Sol's unrefined language and\n\nYou can speak ‘the way you suggested’ within a week.\n\nif there is\n\nHe answers that he will accept Lee Sol’s confession.\n\nWill Lee Sol be able to make a proper confession after a week? A full-fledged 'language' romantic comedy about Lee Sol, who even thinks in 'memes', and Song Ido, who has trouble speaking in an orderly manner!\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Daum](https://webtoon.kakao.com/content/%EC%96%91%EC%95%84%EC%B9%98%EC%9D%98-%EC%8A%A4%ED%94%BC%EC%B9%98/2788), [KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/62866623)",
